  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；強\n[MBG/品種] Best in full sun in the northern part of its growing range, but appreciates some afternoon shade in climates with hot, humid summers.\n[MBG/品種] Foliage color tends to green up in hot summer climates as the summer progresses.\n[NC State/品種] In the south, it may benefit from some afternoon shade.\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（品種の記述）は 中 相当。おぎはら植物園の値を採った\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: South-facing or North-facing or West-facing or East-facing",
